cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use BaitBench, please cite it as below."
title: BaitBench
abstract: >-
  A comprehensive tool for building, assessing, and predicting outcomes for
  hybrid capture enrichment probes. BaitBench unifies probe design, alignment-based
  probe assessment, and thermodynamic simulation of capture and sequencing in a
  single installation, allowing probe panels to be evaluated in silico before
  synthesis.
type: software
